Level Zero API headers - fetched at build time from public upstream.

Component:   Level Zero (oneAPI Level Zero specification headers)
Upstream:    https://github.com/oneapi-src/level-zero
Version:     pinned by LEVEL_ZERO_COMMIT_ID in tools/unitrace/CMakeLists.txt, the
             single source of truth (not repeated here)
License:     MIT (see ./LICENSE)

How it is used: scripts/get_ze_headers.py clones level-zero at
LEVEL_ZERO_COMMIT_ID and copies the API headers into the build tree; unitrace
compiles against them.

To bump: update LEVEL_ZERO_COMMIT_ID, refresh LICENSE from upstream at the new
version, and update tools/unitrace/third-party-programs.txt if the license or
copyright changed.
